// Encantis 0.2.1: a global cannot be a slice: it is emitted as one wasm global
// with two initializers.
//   encantis wasm 08-slice-global.ents
//     -> WAT error: type mismatch at end of initializer expression, expected [] but got [i32]
// (encantis check passes.) Workaround used in weave.ents: a pointer global and a
// length global (order, norder), and a function that pairs them (order_list).

global order: []i32 = (0, 0)

export func count() -> u32 => order.len
